## 1. Overview & Goals

### What "Online" means for SusWord

SusWord's core mechanic requires **stealth role distribution** — each player privately sees their own role screen. In the pass-and-play (offline) mode the phone is physically passed around. Online mode means every player is on their own device; the server must:

- Distribute the secret word to civilians and `"???"` to the imposter **privately per connection**, never broadcasting the word to all.
- Synchronise the discussion timer across all devices.
- Orchestrate voting without revealing who voted for whom until submission is confirmed.
- Support players rejoining mid-session if they lose connectivity.

### Non-Goals (v1)

- Spectator mode
- Voice/video integration
- Ranked matchmaking
- Chat within the app
- More than one game per room simultaneously

