## 2. Game Flow Mapping

| Offline Phase | Online Equivalent | Who triggers it |
|---|---|---|
| `home` | Player lands on `/online` page, creates or joins a room | Each player independently |
| `setup` | **Host** configures players, timer, and presses Start | Host only |
| `revealing` | Server sends each player their private role; client shows reveal screen | Server (pushed per connection) |
| `ready` | Host confirms all players have seen their word | Last player clicks "Ready" triggers auto-advance |
| `discussing` | Server-authoritative countdown synced to all | Server broadcasts tick or target timestamp |
| `voting` | **Host** submits the voted player; server records it | Host only |
| `result` | Server broadcasts elimination result | Server |
| `gameOver` | Server broadcasts final result with imposter revealed | Server |

