## 3. Core Data Models

### 3.1 Player

```go
type Player struct {
    ID          string    // UUID v4, assigned on WS connect
    DisplayName string    // e.g. "Alice"
    RoomCode    string
    ConnectedAt time.Time
    IsHost      bool
    IsReady     bool      // true once they've tapped through their reveal screen
    IsActive    bool      // false after elimination; still connected as observer
    conn        *websocket.Conn
    send        chan []byte
}
```

### 3.2 Room

```go
type Room struct {
    Code            string              // 6 uppercase alphanumeric, e.g. "XK92PL"
    Players         map[string]*Player   // keyed by Player.ID
    HostID          string
    Phase           Phase
    SecretWord      string
    SecretCategory  string
    ImposterID      string
    ActivePlayerIDs []string           // ordered; shrinks as eliminations occur
    EliminationLog  []EliminationRecord
    LastEliminated  *EliminationRecord
    Winner          string              // "civilians" | "imposter" | ""
    TimerDuration   int                 // seconds
    TimerEndsAt     *time.Time          // nil until discussion starts; authoritative
    RevealOrder     []string            // PlayerIDs in reveal sequence
    RevealIndex     int                 // index into RevealOrder
    WordHistory     map[string]bool     // recent words, to avoid repeats
    CreatedAt       time.Time
    mu              sync.RWMutex
}
```

### 3.3 Phase (mirrors the offline store)

```go
type Phase string

const (
    PhaseLobby      Phase = "lobby"      // players joining, host configuring
    PhaseRevealing  Phase = "revealing"  // private role reveal in progress
    PhaseReady      Phase = "ready"      // everyone has seen; host starts timer
    PhaseDiscussing Phase = "discussing" // timer running, open debate
    PhaseVoting     Phase = "voting"     // discussion ended, host picks target
    PhaseResult     Phase = "result"     // elimination announced
    PhaseGameOver   Phase = "gameOver"   // winner determined
)
```

### 3.4 EliminationRecord

```go
type EliminationRecord struct {
    PlayerID    string `json:"playerId"`
    DisplayName string `json:"displayName"`
    WasImposter bool   `json:"wasImposter"`
    RoundNumber int    `json:"round"`
}
```

### 3.5 WordEntry

```go
type WordEntry struct {
    Word     string `json:"word"`
    Category string `json:"category"`
}
```

