## 6. Game State Machine

```
lobby
  └─[START_GAME, host, 4-10 players]──▶ revealing
      └─[all PLAYER_READY received]────▶ ready
          └─[START_DISCUSSION, host]───▶ discussing
              └─[timer expires / host]─▶ voting
                  └─[ELIMINATE_PLAYER]─▶ result ──[NEXT_ROUND]──▶ discussing
                                      └─▶ gameOver
```

### State transition guards

| From | Action | Guard |
|---|---|---|
| `lobby` | `START_GAME` | isHost && playerCount 4–10 && all connected |
| `revealing` | `PLAYER_READY` | sender == current reveal player (RevealOrder[RevealIndex]) |
| `ready` | `START_DISCUSSION` | isHost |
| `discussing` | `DISCUSSION_ENDED` | server timer fires, or host triggers early |
| `voting` | `ELIMINATE_PLAYER` | isHost && target is in activePlayers |
| `result` | `NEXT_ROUND` | isHost |
| `gameOver` | `PLAY_AGAIN` | isHost |
| `gameOver` | `NEW_GAME` | isHost |

