## 8. HTTP REST Endpoints

```
POST   /api/rooms
GET    /api/rooms/:code          -- validate room exists, get player list for lobby UI
GET    /ws?room=CODE&name=NAME   -- WebSocket upgrade
GET    /api/health               -- server health check
```

### `POST /api/rooms`
Request: empty body or `{ "hostName": "Alice" }`.  
Response:
```json
{
  "roomCode": "XK92PL",
  "wsUrl": "wss://susword.example.com/ws?room=XK92PL&name=Alice",
  "expiresAt": "2026-10-07T16:35:00Z"
}
```

### `GET /api/rooms/:code`
Response `200`:
```json
{
  "roomCode": "XK92PL",
  "phase": "lobby",
  "playerCount": 3,
  "maxPlayers": 10,
  "joinable": true
}
```
Response `404` if room not found.  
Response `200` with `"joinable": false` if game is in progress.

