## 10. Word List Management

- Port `lib/words.ts` to a Go slice of `WordEntry` structs in `internal/game/words.go`.
- Room-level `WordHistory map[string]bool` tracks the last `floor(N/3)` words used in that room, preventing repeats across `PLAY_AGAIN` rounds.
- The history is scoped to the room and cleared on `NEW_GAME`.
- No global shared word history between rooms (avoids race conditions and simplifies scaling).
- Category is always sent to the imposter (as in the offline version).

