## 13. Deployment Considerations

### Single binary
```bash
go build -o susword-server ./cmd/server
```
No runtime dependencies beyond the binary.

### Behind nginx (recommended)
```nginx
location /ws {
    proxy_pass http://localhost:8080;
    proxy_http_version 1.1;
    proxy_set_header Upgrade $http_upgrade;
    proxy_set_header Connection "upgrade";
    proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
    proxy_read_timeout 86400s;   # Keep WS connections alive
}
location /api {
    proxy_pass http://localhost:8080;
    proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
}
```

### Scaling
- v1: Single instance handles ~500 concurrent rooms comfortably.
- v2: Add Redis-backed state + sticky sessions or consistent hashing by room code across Go instances.

### Health check
`GET /api/health` returns `200 {"status": "ok", "rooms": N}`. Use for load balancer probes.

