## 15. Open Questions

These need product decisions before implementation begins:

| # | Question | Options |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | **Reconnect on role reassignment**: if a player rejoins after `GAME_OVER`, do they see the final state or the lobby? | Show final state for 30s, then reset |
| 2 | **Imposter win on timer expiry**: if the timer runs out and no vote happens, does the imposter win? | Yes (classic social deduction) |
| 3 | **Kick system**: can the host kick a player from the lobby? | Desirable for v1 |
| 4 | **Private chat**: do players need any in-app messaging? | Out of scope for v1 |
| 5 | **Word expansion**: server-managed word list (updatable without redeploy) or compiled-in? | Redis/JSON file for v1.5 |
| 6 | **Mobile notification on your turn**: push notification when reveal reaches you? | Web Push API, optional |
| 7 | **CORS in production**: locked to the Next.js app domain or open? | Locked to `ALLOWED_ORIGINS` env var |
| 8 | **Authentication**: anonymous (display name + UUID) or require accounts? | Anonymous for v1 |

